WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for the 60 second promo video. Replace together with the video.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
[Music]

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.900
Your servers never sleep.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.200
So who's watching them?

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.000
MonitorFlow. Watch, alert and update your Linux and Windows servers. All from one web page.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.600
A small agent on each server.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
It only connects out. Nothing to open in your firewall. Encrypted, with mutual TLS on both ends.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:27.600
A limit is crossed? You know right away, by email, webhook, Slack, Teams or Discord.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.600
AI suggests a fix. You approve it.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.400
Nothing runs without a person saying yes.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:44.000
Updates roll out in waves, in the hours you choose.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:50.600
Running servers for customers? Keep each one apart.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:55.600
Up and running in 5 minutes.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
MonitorFlow. Free and open source. github.com/Kidoly/monitorflow
